ungen sind hochgradig anpassbar und k\u00f6nnen f\u00fcr eigene Projekte genutzt werden.", "short_description": "Artivact ist ein kostenloses, quelloffenes Werkzeug zur Sammlungsverwaltung und -pr\u00e4sentation.\nMit Artivact XR kannst du diese Sammlungen in der virtuellen Realit\u00e4t erleben."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "quest_portrait.png", "id": "4209759382644599", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393841_4209759385977932_3266183942185304833_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B2fBS8txAH4Q7kNvwFYLm1r&_nc_oc=AdojTLwa-3ZoBimR8lXJJui41kIcXwvpA6mQ2EAL8-SJu0llXsDNQSCpaGUECQUpx4M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNfUFCjZmghb1fvrzDCKXc46keH0PNVkmgQo_qENClv6A&oe=6AE4B5FC"}, {"file_name": "quest_hero_cover.png", "id": "1263316755151138", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292244_1263316758484471_159357681156275043_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZqHQ15Phq5MQ7kNvwHcBExM&_nc_oc=AdruknDZWunSzWgTHEqZQQn_Wlnmud0sTE8gjQwWviGv9LYcaw6_l1EUbvRQClH3vXg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOBcnCQqdsjSYaO6U3hf1O9BCdL_8Ok0-q8QRZvgzWAQw&oe=6AE49A16"}, {"file_name": "quest_landscape.png", "id": "1039024501005104", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_1039024504338437_7487200977707356540_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fQgLjyz9vZoQ7kNvwGedPKe&_nc_oc=AdpraYZLD5dIJgGxF-39EZ-5AhJd0ezVL22sJEstT3jaMDX7vvhBJiM4V_kLwF7L0iE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNtHnYyKBn1cRe6q4fUK6Yi2o5KDf-kPqyJhOpENitp6A&oe=6AE4A7E4"}, {"file_name": "quest_logo.png", "id": "707346191636121", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302233_707346198302787_7894586970020286030_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_